<title>GERMANY: DePfa up after says believes UBS buys shrs.</title>
<headline>DePfa up after says believes UBS buys shrs.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German mortgage bank DePfa-Bank AG rose strongly in pre-bourse trade on Tuesday after it said it had received indications that Switzerland's UBS group had bought a significant stake in it.</p>
<p>Shares in DePfa rose 2.50 marks to 83, rising later to 83.50 marks, after it said a shareholder study showed that UBS had purchased a substantial part of Depfa-Bank's capital in the open market.</p>
<p>It added that it believed that UBS held approximately nine percent of DePfa-Bank's equity.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
